    "Sharing uses the default profile’s data without merging or deleting this profile’s own data. Turn sharing off to return to its own data. Deleting shared history or bookmarks affects all profiles using it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
