            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use the bottom panel to enable highlighting or erasing, then select text. Click a saved highlight to erase it. Turning Highlighter off hides saved highlights without deleting them. Private highlights last only for that private window."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在底部面板中启用高亮或擦除，然后选择文本。点按已保存的高亮即可擦除。关闭高亮标记会隐藏已保存的标记，但不会删除。无痕窗口中的标记仅在该窗口内保留。"
          }
        }
      }
